# Round-4 run plan, priority (e): SHRINCS stateless signing, measured as on the other
# boards. Run after rp2350.plan:
#   scripts/r4_rp2350_queue.sh scripts/r4_plans/rp2350-stateless.plan \
#       results/raw/rp2350/r4
# Fields: build|set|n. Run counts are reduced below level 3 on one core, because one run
# takes 7 to 45 minutes here: n=10 at level 3 on one core,
